def Xform "ScissorA" (
    prepend apiSchemas = ["PhysicsRigidBodyAPI", "PhysicsMassAPI", "PhysicsArticulationRootAPI"]
    doc = "A 203 mm office scissors (Fiskars 8 in class, 60 g): stainless-steel blades and orange plastic loop handles on a rivet at the origin. Link ScissorA is the upper blade and its handle; ScissorB is the lower blade and its handle, on a Z revolute 'Shear' with a light torsional spring (it opens). +X points to the blade tips; the paper plane is z=0. The robot clamps the two handles' outer faces with one gripper."
)
